      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I agree. I constantly use avatar culling at big events and it does save a lot on resources so I can get just enough fps to not be nauseous. I agree that in general it feels underwhelming when it comes to giving me options on allow for certain people to bypass given certain situations like you mentioned above. I would appreciate expansions to this already helpful feature to better my experience.",
